'uri': 'nyt://article/4a0e9b8e-ed59-5a17-94a6-9a453c3d697f'}, {'abstract': 'Joseph J. Salvo, who is retiring after nearly 30 years as New York City’s chief demographer, is optimistic about New York City’s recovery after the pandemic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/01/nyregion/nyc-population-pandemic-recovery.html', 'snippet': 'Joseph J. Salvo, who is retiring after nearly 30 years as New York City’s chief demographer, is optimistic about New York City’s recovery after the pandemic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In nearly three decades as New York City’s chief demographer at the Department of City Planning, Joseph J. Salvo has been the top expert on the city’s population, providing data and analysis of the city’s always-changing populace to help city officials, community organizers and journalists understand the most diverse city in the world.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/30/nyregion/00nysalvo1/00nysalvo1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/30/nyregion/00nysalvo1/00nysalvo1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/30/nyregion/00nysalvo1/00nysalvo1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/30/nyregion/00nysalvo1/00nysalvo1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/30/nyregion/00nysalvo1/00nysalvo1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'wid