name': 'Kwai', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d3b05ee9-6232-517a-97ed-2077ee04b29f', 'word_count': 857, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d3b05ee9-6232-517a-97ed-2077ee04b29f'}, {'abstract': 'Francisco Lindor’s Mets debut will have to wait after Washington had at least three positive coronavirus tests among its players, and several other players who had been in close contact.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/01/sports/baseball/mets-nationals-postponed-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'Francisco Lindor’s Mets debut will have to wait after Washington had at least three positive coronavirus tests among its players, and several other players who had been in close contact.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Major League Baseball sailed through roughly six weeks of spring training without any major coronavirus disruptions, but just hours before first pitches were set to be thrown across the country, the problem lurched up again.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/01/sports/01mlb-lindor/merlin_184159893_00b8524f-0dd2-4407-8abe-aad4161ff323-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/01/sports/01mlb-lindor/merlin_184159893_00b8524f-0dd2-4407-8abe-aad4161ff323-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/01/sports/01mlb-lindor/merlin_184159893_00b8524f-0dd2-4407-8abe-aad4161ff323-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/01/sports/01mlb-lindor/merlin_184159893_