/us/politics/border-migrant-families-children.html', 'snippet': 'More migrant families are entering the United States and being released, new figures for March show, as thousands of children remain in detention facilities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Biden administration apprehended more than 170,000 migrants at the southwest border in March, the most in any month for at least 15 years and up nearly 70 percent from February, as thousands of children remained backed up in detention facilities and border agents released an increasing number of migrant families into the United States, government documents obtained by The New York Times show.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/02/us/politics/02dc-border/merlin_185550798_2c0cc717-284f-45bf-9129-fb9d22e4e1e9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/02/us/politics/02dc-border/merlin_185550798_2c0cc717-284f-45bf-9129-fb9d22e4e1e9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/02/us/politics/02dc-border/merlin_185550798_2c0cc717-284f-45bf-9129-fb9d22e4e1e9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/02/us/politics/02dc-border/merlin_185550798_2c0cc717-284f-45bf-9129-fb9d22e4e1e9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/02/us/politics/02dc-border/02dc-border-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, '