1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Boris Johnson Announces Free Coronavirus Tests and Status Certificates for England', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'England to Offer Free Covid Tests and a Plan for Status Certificates', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantines', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Boris', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'England', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-05T18:09:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Landler and Stephen Castle', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Landler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Castle', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3219906-bdd6-504a-af1d-29f31a8ed2df', 'word_count': 1111, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e3219906-bdd6-504a-af1d-29f31a8ed2df'}, {'abstract': 'The baker Melissa Funk Weller will sell cookies and bars for pickup and delivery under the name Funk Foods Bakery.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/05/dining/cookies-brooklyn-bakery.html', 'snippet': 'The baker Melissa Funk Weller will sell cookies and bars for pickup and delivery under the name Funk Foods Bakery.', 'lead_paragraph': "Melissa Funk Weller, a baker whose résumé includes Per Se, Bouchon Bakery, High Street on Hudson, Roberta’s and, most notably, Sadelle’s, where she made bagels, is starting a brand of her own: Funk Foods Bakery. She doesn’t have a location yet; for now she’s baking in a restaurant kitchen in Williamsburg, Brooklyn. Starting Thursday she will sell boxes of assorted cookies and bars, 13 for $38. For now, a new assortment will make its debut on the first of each month, including one with Mother's Day in mind on May 1. They’re available only on Tuesdays for pickup from 10 a.m. until 2 p.m., and for national shipping on those days; a shop is on the horizon. April’s tins include peanut butter-layered brownies, raspberry-fig whole wheat bars that echo Fig Newtons, and salt-dusted shortbreads.", 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05Burner-bake/05Burner-bake-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 588, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05Burner-bake/05Burner-bake-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 588}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05Burner-bake/05Burner-bake-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1004, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05Burner-bake/05Burner-bake-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2008, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05Burner-bake/05Burner-bake-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05Burner-bake/05Burner-bake-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05Burner-bake/05Burner-bake-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cookie Tins Straight From Brooklyn', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Nibble: Cookie Tins Straight From Brooklyn', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bakeries and Baked Products', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-05T18:14:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5a1d5675-ddd3-55ea-baba-0c0b715a9040', 'word_count': 175, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5a1d5675-ddd3-55ea-baba-0c0b715a9040'}, {'abstract': 'The Conscious Collection includes lots of wine and spirits, as well as extravagant experiences like truffle hunting in Italy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/05/dining/auction-benefit-restaurants.html', 'snippet': 'The Conscious Collection includes lots of wine and spirits, as well as extravagant experiences like truffle hunting in Italy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Conscious Collection, an auction to raise money for restaurants and bars in need, will be held by Zachys on Friday. It includes more than 100 lots of exceptional wines, spirits and over-the-top experiences like dinner for eight at Château Margaux, another with Christian Moueix at Dominus, three bottles of 2016 Screaming Eagle, and truffle hunting for four in Piedmont, Italy, with a stay at the Ceretto estate. Sponsored by Southern Glazer’s Wine & Spirits and Wine Spectator, the auction will donate the money to the Barstool Fund for hospitality-industry applicants, administered by the nonprofit 30-Day Fund, which has been raising money nationwide. Online bidding is open, and the live (virtual) auction will begin on Friday at 6 p.m. Eastern time. Absentee bids must be submitted by 5:45 p.m. on Friday. For most of the lots that involve travel, winners will have a year to fulfill the experience, unless specified otherwise. So far, bidding has started at about $500. To participate, bidders must first register.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05burner-bid/05burner-bid-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05burner-bid/05burner-bid-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05burner-bid/05burner-bid-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05burner-bid/05burner-bid-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1067, 'width': 1600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05burner-bid/05burner-bid-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05burner-bid/05burner-bid-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type':