d before you.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the start of the year, Shay Fan felt relief: Vaccinations were on their way. Her relief turned to joy when her parents and in-laws got their shots.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/30/multimedia/00xp-virus-vaccine-fomo2/merlin_185656311_6b64aeba-27af-4adc-a279-1327d67a0b16-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/30/multimedia/00xp-virus-vaccine-fomo2/merlin_185656311_6b64aeba-27af-4adc-a279-1327d67a0b16-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/30/multimedia/00xp-virus-vaccine-fomo2/merlin_185656311_6b64aeba-27af-4adc-a279-1327d67a0b16-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/30/multimedia/00xp-virus-vaccine-fomo2/merlin_185656311_6b64aeba-27af-4adc-a279-1327d67a0b16-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/30/multimedia/00xp-virus-vaccine-fomo2/00xp-virus-vaccine-fomo2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/30/multimedia/00xp-virus-vaccine-fomo2/00xp-virus-vaccine-fomo2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/30/multimedia/00xp-virus-vaccine-fomo2/00xp-virus-vaccine-fomo2-