ce said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A man attending his daughter’s birthday party in Brooklyn on Monday night turned the joyful celebration into a scene of carnage when he shot and killed her mother and two sisters, the police said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/06/nyregion/06triple-slay/06triple-slay-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/06/nyregion/06triple-slay/06triple-slay-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/06/nyregion/06triple-slay/06triple-slay-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/06/nyregion/06triple-slay/06triple-slay-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/06/nyregion/06triple-slay/06triple-slay-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/06/nyregion/06triple-slay/06triple-slay-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/06/nyregion/06triple-slay/06triple-slay-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Her Dad Came to Her Birthday Party. Then He Killed Her Family.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Man Kills Daughter’s Mother And Sisters at Birthday Party', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Domestic Violence', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Van Dyke Houses (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brownsville (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCrimon, Joseph (d 2021)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spears, Solei (d 2021)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spears, Chloe (d 2021)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barzey, Rasheeda (d 2021)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-06T14:14:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Southall, Michael Gold and Matthew Sedacca', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Southall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gold', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sedacca', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ed8c745c-e499-51ad-b6f9-e18ae979ddc1', 'word_count': 990, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ed8c745c-e499-51ad-b6f9-e18ae979ddc1'}, {'abstract': 'Fany Gerson of La Newyorkina will sell them at Fan-Fan Doughnuts in Brooklyn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/06/dining/chocolate-doughnuts-la-newyorkina.html', 'snippet': 'Fany Gerson of La Newyorkina will sell them at Fan-Fan Doughnuts in Brooklyn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fany Gerson of La Newyorkina, which sells Mexican sweets, prepared foods and groceries, will hold a chocolate doughnut celebration at her Brooklyn shop, Fan-Fan Doughnuts, from April 13 through 15. With travel so restricted because of the pandemic, her thought was to evoke faraway destinations through flavors like rooibos (South Africa), sticky toffee (the United Kingdom), blue corn (Mexico) and pistachios (Iran). The company Guittard is supplying the chocolate for this tasty little event. The doughnuts are $3.50 to $5 each and will be sold from 9 a.m. until 4 p.m., or whenever they sell out. They can be reserved between noon and 4 p.m. a day in advance.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05burner-chocolate/05burner-chocolate-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 927, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05burner-chocolate/05burner-chocolate-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 927}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05burner-chocolate/05burner-chocolate-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 663, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05burner-chocolate/05burner-chocolate-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1326, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/dining/05burner-chocolate/05burner-chocolate-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandar