 come in yearly. Some experts contend that frequent mammograms can “do more harm than good.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/06/health/breast-cancer-scans.html', 'snippet': 'A panel recommends biennial screenings, starting at 50, but a new study took issue with the way hundreds of centers are telling women 40 and up to come in yearly. Some experts contend that frequent mammograms can “do more harm than good.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'My last breast cancer screening was “b.c.” — before Covid — just a few weeks before the mysterious new disease was detected in China. The timing was perfect: Everything was normal, and by the time we went into lockdown, my to-do list no longer included a mammogram.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/01/science/00virus-mammograms-1/merlin_183120819_6f468721-0ff3-403c-8f0f-742d6217b860-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/01/science/00virus-mammograms-1/merlin_183120819_6f468721-0ff3-403c-8f0f-742d6217b860-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/01/science/00virus-mammograms-1/merlin_183120819_6f468721-0ff3-403c-8f0f-742d6217b860-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/01/science/00virus-mammograms-1/merlin_183120819_6f468721-0ff3-403c-8f0f-742d6217b860-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1394, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/01/science/00virus-mammograms-1/merlin_183120819_6f4