aily/tax-scheme-bristol-myers-irs-janet-yellen.html', 'snippet': 'How one U.S. multinational used overseas shelters to slash its tax bill — and how the Biden administration plans to crack down on such practices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For decades, U.S. multinationals have been stowing trillions of dollars overseas as a way to slash their tax bills.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Targeting Overseas Tax Shelters', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Shelters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corporate Taxes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bristol Myers Squibb Company', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Treasury Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-07T10:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Podcasts', 'section_name': 'Podcasts', 'subsection_name': 'The Daily', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/636a7929-e673-5293-a1bc-de3e48190fe3', 'word_count': 338, 'uri': 'nyt://article/636a7929-e673-5293-a1bc-de3e48190fe3'}, {'abstract': 'You may not expect to see them in your yard, but that doesn’t mean you’ve got trouble. The opposite, in fact.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/07/realestate/whats-up-with-those-weird-looking-mushrooms.html', 'snippet': 'You may not expect to see them in your yard, but that doesn’t mean you’ve got trouble. The opposite, in fact.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They appear spontaneously, or so it seems, popping up out of the mulch, rising in a single spot on the lawn or bursting from between the pathway pavers like little marshmallows. But there is an intricate master plan at work, just not one to which most gardeners are privy.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/realestate/07garden1/oakImage-1617660080987-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/11/realestate/07garden1/oakImage-1617660080987-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/realestate/07garden1/oakImage-1617660080987-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/realestate/07garden1/oakImage-1617660080987-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/realestate/07garden1/oakImage-1617660080987-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/11/realestate/07garden1/oakImage-1617660080987-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/realestate/07garden1/oakImage-1617660080987-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s Up With Those Weird-Looking Mushrooms?', 'kicker': 'IN THE GARDEN', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 