7831695f-ef72-59bf-b1b2-c12561c9047e'}, {'abstract': 'The tax plan would raise the corporate rate to 28 percent from 21 percent to help fund the president’s economic agenda.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/07/business/biden-corporate-tax-increases.html', 'snippet': 'The tax plan would raise the corporate rate to 28 percent from 21 percent to help fund the president’s economic agenda.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Biden administration unveiled its plan to overhaul the corporate tax code on Wednesday, offering an array of proposals that would require large companies to pay higher taxes to help fund the White House’s economic agenda.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/us/politics/07new-was-yellen/merlin_184627521_b4c441d7-4c96-4d65-b3e8-fd50d761365a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/07/us/politics/07new-was-yellen/merlin_184627521_b4c441d7-4c96-4d65-b3e8-fd50d761365a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/us/politics/07new-was-yellen/merlin_184627521_b4c441d7-4c96-4d65-b3e8-fd50d761365a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/us/politics/07new-was-yellen/merlin_184627521_b4c441d7-4c96-4d65-b3e8-fd50d761365a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/us/politics/07new-was-yellen/merlin_184627521_b4c441d7-4c96-4d65-b3e8-fd50d761365a-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/07/us/politics/07new-was-yellen/merlin_184627521_b4c441d7-4c96-4d65-b3e8-fd50d761365a-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/07/us/politics/07new-was-yellen/merlin_184627521_b4c441d7-4c96-4d65-b3e8-fd50d761365a-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Biden administration seeks to raise $2.5 trillion through corporate tax increases.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corporate Taxes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Shelters', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Treasury Department', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alternative and Renewable Energy', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-07T15:30:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Rappeport', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rappeport', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0592c150-5f07-55cb-9d1d-691f80a085e8', 'word_count': 659, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0592c150-5f07-55cb-9d1d-691f80a085e8'}, {'abstract': 'More than 25 million lower-income Americans received their stimulus payments on Wednesday. Certain veterans could get theirs next week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/07/business/veterans-stimulus-checks.html', 'snippet': 'More than 25 million lower-income Americans received their stimulus payments on Wednesday. Certain veterans could get theirs next week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than 25 million lower-income Americans whose stimulus payments were delayed finally received them on Wednesday. And one group still waiting — certain veterans and their beneficiaries — can expect their payments to arrive next week, the Internal Revenue Service said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Millions of delayed stimulus payments have arrived. Veterans are next.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stimulus (Economic)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Internal Revenue Service', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans Affairs Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-07T15:41:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tara Siegel Bernard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tara', 'middlename': 'Siegel', 'lastname': 'Bernard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e742532f-76bc-588d-8a80-991e59bc66b0', 'word_count': 267, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e742532f-76bc-588d-8a80-991e59bc66b0'}, {'abstract': 'A scientific mission to China proposed further study for a number of topics. Critics and the director of the W.H.O. have weighed in as well.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/07/health/coronavirus-lab-leak-who.html', 'snipp