cks at the Sistine Ceiling. But at a certain point, the direction of travel was reversed. New York became the imperial art capital, and European artists considered it obligatory to come here and meet the gang. When did that moment occur? Perhaps on Dec. 3, 1963, when Mario Schifano, a 29-year-old Italian artist enamored of novelty, arrived in New York.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/09/arts/08mario-schifano-1/merlin_185646447_75e1ff85-f0eb-42f5-bd74-3b9a8fbe0e53-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 747, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/09/arts/08mario-schifano-1/merlin_185646447_75e1ff85-f0eb-42f5-bd74-3b9a8fbe0e53-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 747}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/09/arts/08mario-schifano-1/merlin_185646447_75e1ff85-f0eb-42f5-bd74-3b9a8fbe0e53-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 823, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/09/arts/08mario-schifano-1/merlin_185646447_75e1ff85-f0eb-42f5-bd74-3b9a8fbe0e53-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1645, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/09/arts/08mario-schifano-1/08mario-schifano-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/09/arts/08mario-schifano-1/08mario-schifano-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur