'_id': 'nyt://article/b407507c-1334-54cf-9a15-30d9636e369e', 'word_count': 396, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b407507c-1334-54cf-9a15-30d9636e369e'}, {'abstract': 'Once again, the state is shaping up to be a case study in the complexities around the politics of race and power.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/08/us/politics/virginia-governor-race-terry-mcauliffe.html', 'snippet': 'Once again, the state is shaping up to be a case study in the complexities around the politics of race and power.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two years ago, when a racist blackface picture emerged from the 1980s that appeared to include Gov. Ralph Northam of Virginia, the blowback was swift and severe. There were mounting calls for his resignation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/08/us/politics/08onpolitics-pm/oakImage-1617905918093-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/08/us/politics/08onpolitics-pm/oakImage-1617905918093-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 688}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/08/us/politics/08onpolitics-pm/oakImage-1617905918093-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 894, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/08/us/politics/08onpolitics-pm/oakImage-1617905918093-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1787, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/08/us/politics/08onpolitics-pm/oakImage-1617905918093-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legac