c-bd30-2d64aec06c22'}, {'abstract': 'Sue Jin Lee was hungry and cranky, but Amit Seth was not going to be swayed from asking her to marry him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/09/style/sue-jin-lee-amit-seth-wedding.html', 'snippet': 'Sue Jin Lee was hungry and cranky, but Amit Seth was not going to be swayed from asking her to marry him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Amit Seth began to propose to Sue Jin Lee in 2019 on a balcony overlooking the ocean in Ischia, an Italian island off the coast of Naples, she walked away, back inside their hotel room. She wasn’t overcome with emotion or opposed to getting engaged. She was hungry, cranky, and she had already moved past trying to anticipate when Mr. Seth was going to ask her to be his wife.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/fashion/weddings/00LeeSeth-02/00LeeSeth-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/11/fashion/weddings/00LeeSeth-02/00LeeSeth-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/fashion/weddings/00LeeSeth-02/00LeeSeth-02-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/fashion/weddings/00LeeSeth-02/00LeeSeth-02-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/fashion/weddings/00LeeSeth-02/00LeeSeth-02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name