iselli had graduated from Princeton; Ms. Moy had, too. Ms. Ingriselli was starting a career in law; Ms. Moy was eyeing law school. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/fashion/weddings/11IngriselliMoy/00IngriselliMoy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 945, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/11/fashion/weddings/11IngriselliMoy/00IngriselliMoy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 945}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/fashion/weddings/11IngriselliMoy/00IngriselliMoy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 650, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/fashion/weddings/11IngriselliMoy/00IngriselliMoy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1300, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/fashion/weddings/11IngriselliMoy/00IngriselliMoy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/11/fashion/weddings/11IngriselliMoy/00IngriselliMoy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/fashion/weddings/11IngriselliMoy/00IngriselliMoy-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'They Didn’t Need a Dating App After All', 'kicker': 'mini-vows', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'They Didn