 Andrew Yang and Eric Adams, lead the mayoral race.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/10/nyregion/yang-adams-mayor-progressives.html', 'snippet': 'Even as New York has veered toward the left, two more-moderate candidates, Andrew Yang and Eric Adams, lead the mayoral race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over the last year, New York politics have appeared to lurch ever leftward. First came the primary victories last summer in a series of House and state legislative races, then the legalization of recreational marijuana, and just this week, a state budget agreement that would raise taxes on the wealthy and create a $2.1 billion fund to aid undocumented workers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/09/nyregion/00nymayor-progressives1-02/00nymayor-progressives1-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/09/nyregion/00nymayor-progressives1-02/00nymayor-progressives1-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/09/nyregion/00nymayor-progressives1-02/00nymayor-progressives1-02-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/09/nyregion/00nymayor-progressives1-02/00nymayor-progressives1-02-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/09/nyregion/00nymayor-progressives1-02/00nymayor-progressives1-02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail'