', '_id': 'nyt://article/0175b693-287a-5109-9de0-1ebe4e7c6027', 'word_count': 1772, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0175b693-287a-5109-9de0-1ebe4e7c6027'}, {'abstract': 'Arkansas lawmakers’ move against trans people reflects a larger strategy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/10/opinion/sunday/transgender-rights-republicans-arkansas.html', 'snippet': 'Arkansas lawmakers’ move against trans people reflects a larger strategy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Straight people have often asked me what I, a gay man, have in common with someone who’s trans. Gay people have often put that question to themselves. There are many answers. Here’s one: I know what it’s like to have my identity, my dignity — my very hold on happiness — pressed into partisan battle and fashioned into a political weapon.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/10/opinion/sunday/10bruni_2/10bruni_2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/10/opinion/sunday/10bruni_2/10bruni_2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/10/opinion/sunday/10bruni_2/10bruni_2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/10/opinion/sunday/10bruni_2/10bruni_2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/10/opinion/sunday/10bruni_2/10bruni_2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 't