url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/10/at-home/daydreaming.html', 'snippet': 'Far from a waste of time, daydreaming might be one of the best things you can do with your free time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like many people, Namita Kulkarni has felt trapped during the pandemic. When this travel blogger’s typically intrepid life suddenly became stuck in place, she sought her next adventure in her imagination.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/multimedia/11ah-daydreamingillo/11ah-daydreamingillo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 622, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/11/multimedia/11ah-daydreamingillo/11ah-daydreamingillo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 622}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/multimedia/11ah-daydreamingillo/11ah-daydreamingillo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 988, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/multimedia/11ah-daydreamingillo/11ah-daydreamingillo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1975, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/multimedia/11ah-daydreamingillo/11ah-daydreamingillo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/11/multimedia/11ah-daydreamingillo/11ah-daydreamingillo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/11/mul