ight': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/12/multimedia/12sp-resilience-unhappy/12sp-resilience-unhappy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/multimedia/12sp-resilience-unhappy/12sp-resilience-unhappy-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Don’t Mistake Silent Endurance for Resilience', 'kicker': 'Resilience', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantine (Life and Culture)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agents (Business)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-12T09:00:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SpecialSections', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Priyanka Mattoo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Priyanka', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mattoo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cfada428-14bf-5d24-bd2e-a28b67d9f11a', 'word_count': 1369, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cfada428-14bf-5d24-bd2e-a28b67d9f11a'}, {'abstract': "Two artists who've stayed close, even as the terms of their relationship have evolved.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/12/t-magazine/jessica-rankin-partners-friends.html', 'snippet': "Two artists who've stayed close, even as the terms of their relationship have evolved.", 'lead_paragraph': 'Jessica Rankin: We met in 2000 in a bar, and got married in 2008. From the start, we were in sync in terms of the way we look at art: the way we think about it and the way it weaves itself through our lives. It’s a conversation that started and never really stopped. When you spend time watching someone work, you get a sense of what they’re striving for, and you trust that they feel that in your work, too. When relationships change, as ours did in 2014 when we separated, you inevitably have to take some space, but it didn’t last that long for us. Julie is one of the people I trust most to talk about my work with, so it was impossible to maintain any kind of distance.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '79', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1238, 'width': 1856, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy/12tmag-mehreturankin-copy-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Partners, Now Friends', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Partners, Now Friends', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mehretu, Julie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Friendship', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality and Bisexuality', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-12T09:00:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Berick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d7f754cb-1c09-559d-aa0d-c8966d207468', 'word_count': 491, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d7f754cb-1c09-559d-aa0d-c8966d207468'}, {'abstract': 'Jared Blake: About four years ago, I’d gotten some gray Eames shell chairs on eBay — and then my dad bought me a single yellow one, but I didn’t want it, so I put it on Craigslist and Ed came to buy it. When we met, he was wearing something I would wear: a fitted Mets cap with a blue oxford, black pants and checkered Vans, the ultimate business-casual, casual-business outfit. It was like a hidden language. He t