: 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-antonio-poem/12tmag-antonio-poem-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Read T a Poem | Antonio Banderas', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Banderas, Antonio', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-12T09:00:18+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carlota Guerrero', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carlota', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Guerrero', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/109c71d1-6b5d-5936-abfe-92ed188f0ad2', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/109c71d1-6b5d-5936-abfe-92ed188f0ad2'}, {'abstract': 'Bianca Saunders: I am a London girl — from South East. It’s as suburban as London gets: lots of green space, and away from the party. I’ve always worked collaboratively. It’s how I get inspired, by bouncing ideas off of other creatives. My work nods to my British and West Indian heritage, my family, but then — through collaborating with people who are from lots of different backgrounds, both creatively and culturally — I can present it through a different lens. I try to address the tension between tradition and evolution in my designs by referencing classic streetwear and avant-garde couture. The aim is to augment the otherwise straightforward deconstruction of classic men’s wear. A design signature of mine is “captured motion”: I experiment with draping to capture a movement, a moment, a feeling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/12/t-magazine/bianca-saunders-creative-friends.html', 'snippet': '', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bianca Saunders: I am a London girl — from South East. It’s as suburban as London gets: lots of green space, and away from the party. I’ve always worked collaboratively. It’s how I get inspired, by bouncing ideas off of other creatives. My work nods to my British and West Indian heritage, my family, but then — through collaborating with people who are from lots of different backgrounds, both creatively and culturally — I can present it through a different lens. I try to address the tension between tradition and evolution in my designs by referencing classic streetwear and avant-garde couture. The aim is to augment the otherwise straightforward deconstruction of classic men’s wear. A design signature of mine is “captured motion”: I experiment with draping to capture a movement, a moment, a feeling.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '56', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-saunders-copy/12tmag-saunders-copy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-saunders-copy/12tmag-saunders-copy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-saunders-copy/12tmag-saunders-copy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-saunders-copy/12tmag-saunders-copy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-saunders-copy/12tmag-saunders-