1e6397-611a-59bd-81ee-235e7d345b8e', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/061e6397-611a-59bd-81ee-235e7d345b8e'}, {'abstract': 'Wish, the ultra-budget e-commerce app, is about as online as shopping gets. What happens when it comes to your neighborhood?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/12/style/wish-local-shopping.html', 'snippet': 'Wish, the ultra-budget e-commerce app, is about as online as shopping gets. What happens when it comes to your neighborhood?', 'lead_paragraph': 'At MRK Computing Solutions, in the Crown Heights neighborhood of Brooklyn, Marc Anglade helps customers with technological needs: computer repair; web and app design; CCTV installation; printing, faxing, scanning. Mr. Anglade, 34, described his small business, which has earned many positive reviews on Google and Yelp, as “a neighborhood Staples.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/15/fashion/12WISH-LOCAL-wedding-lenses/merlin_186006483_021c2777-7dc9-4102-98ca-7ee4e46919bb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/15/fashion/12WISH-LOCAL-wedding-lenses/merlin_186006483_021c2777-7dc9-4102-98ca-7ee4e46919bb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/15/fashion/12WISH-LOCAL-wedding-lenses/merlin_186006483_021c2777-7dc9-4102-98ca-7ee4e46919bb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/15/fashion/12WISH-LOCAL-wedding-lenses/merlin_186006483_021c2777-7dc9-4102-98ca-7ee4e46919bb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/15/fashion/12WISH-LOCAL-wedding-lenses/12WISH-LOCAL-wedding-lenses-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/15/fashion/12WISH-LOCAL-wedding-lenses/12WISH-LOCAL-wedding-lenses-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/15/fashion/12WISH-LOCAL-wedding-lenses/12WISH-LOCAL-wedding-lenses-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Not-Quite-Everything Store', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Global Shopping Goes Local', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Commerce', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wish (Mobile App)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Amazon.com Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-12T09:00:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Herrman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Herrman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e705d6f5-1520-51ff-ac02-ce02581ff2e7', 'word_count': 2067, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e705d6f5-1520-51ff-ac02-ce02581ff2e7'}, {'abstract': 'As kids, they played together. But, as they got older, divisions only faintly perceptible at the time would come between them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/12/t-magazine/friendship-growing-up-apart.html', 'snippet': 'As kids, they played together. But, as they got older, divisions only faintly perceptible at the time would come between them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LITTLE DICKIE POWERS died, and what could I do? We were both 8 — or rather, I was; Dickie was now of no age, zeroed out by what my parents told me, without further explanation, was a burst appendix. I pictured him blown apart in his bedroom. That seemed like a poor choice of imagery for the sympathy card I was making, but was I even sympathetic? I hadn’t liked Dickie much: He once called me a name that was shorthand for “dirty Jew.” His family, then? My mother had hinted, perhaps for my sake because I was a junior hypochondriac, that the Powerses lacked access to adequate medical care: Dickie died because he was poor. My mother, too, had grown up poor; she’d lived above a dime store, dying to get out. I wondered if that was why, aside from it being November, my parents sent his parents a turkey. On my card I finally drew a turkey, too, but with its fancy jewel-tone feathers, mine looked more like a peacock.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '52', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-essays-slide-8YKR-copy/12tmag-essays-slide-8YKR-copy-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-essays-slide-8YKR-copy/12tmag-essays-slide-8YKR-copy-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-essays-slide-8YKR-copy/12tmag-essays-slide-8YKR-copy-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': No