milienne Malfatto', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emilienne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Malfatto', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/56509b1b-f85b-5e28-9895-feb454c45b87', 'word_count': 877, 'uri': 'nyt://article/56509b1b-f85b-5e28-9895-feb454c45b87'}, {'abstract': 'Amandla Stenberg: I remember the first time we met. I was 11 and Rowan was about 9. We were at an event for child actors, and a designer had collaborated with both of us to make our dream dresses — I wore a lace piece with studs, and Rowan had on a little blue-and-pink pirate dress — so we ended up taking a picture together. I met a lot of other young performers at events, and there were weird semblances of friendships, but they were always supposed to be these public things. Rowan and I have found something much more substantial beyond that.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/12/t-magazine/amandla-stenberg-rowan-blanchard.html', 'snippet': '', 'lead_paragraph': 'Amandla Stenberg: I remember the first time we met. I was 11 and Rowan was about 9. We were at an event for child actors, and a designer had collaborated with both of us to make our dream dresses — I wore a lace piece with studs, and Rowan had on a little blue-and-pink pirate dress — so we ended up taking a picture together. I met a lot of other young performers at events, and there were weird semblances of friendships, but they were always supposed to be these public things. Rowan and I have found something much more substantial beyond that.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '75', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-blanchardstenberg-copy/12tmag-blanchardstenberg-copy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'l