friends and I have grown together as people, as artists, as found family. I look to this group for guidance — or just an ear when I want to vent my rage. Even though we’re peers, we mentor each other as we try to widen the path for the next generation in Hollywood. We all had to navigate through a system that wasn’t really built for us.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/12/t-magazine/daniel-kaluuya-queen-slim.html', 'snippet': '', 'lead_paragraph': 'Melina Matsoukas: I’m from New York, but I moved out to Los Angeles 15 years ago, and I didn’t really have a foundation. Since then, my friends and I have grown together as people, as artists, as found family. I look to this group for guidance — or just an ear when I want to vent my rage. Even though we’re peers, we mentor each other as we try to widen the path for the next generation in Hollywood. We all had to navigate through a system that wasn’t really built for us.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '68', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-turinimatsoukas-copy/12tmag-turinimatsoukas-copy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-turinimatsoukas-copy/12tmag-turinimatsoukas-copy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-turinimatsoukas-copy/12tmag-turinimatsoukas-copy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/t-magazine/12tmag-turinimatsoukas-copy/12tmag-turinimatsoukas-copy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo