 (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/206f4c28-6dc4-58c8-b3e5-b54c205c9708', 'word_count': 586, 'uri': 'nyt://article/206f4c28-6dc4-58c8-b3e5-b54c205c9708'}, {'abstract': 'Britain reopens after one of the world’s longest and strictest lockdowns.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/12/us/coronavirus-today-vaccines.html', 'snippet': 'Britain reopens after one of the world’s longest and strictest lockdowns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After one of the longest and most stringent lockdowns in the world, Britain began to emerge today from its virus restrictions. The country has made a number of unsuccessful attempts to reopen over the past year, but there is widespread hope that, this time, it may finally be reaching the beginning of the end.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/multimedia/12coronavirus-nl/12coronavirus-nl-articleLarge.png', 'height': 492, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/12/multimedia/12coronavirus-nl/12coronavirus-nl-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 492}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/multimedia/12coronavirus-nl/12coronavirus-nl-jumbo.png', 'height': 839, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/multimedia/12coronavirus-nl/12coronavirus-nl-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1026, 'width': 1252, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/multimedia/12coronavirus-nl/12coronavirus-nl-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': '