 {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salazar, Julia Christine', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biaggi, Alessandra', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gunning, Patricia', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simotas, Aravella', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-12T22:03:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sydney Ember, J. David Goodman and Luis Ferré-Sadurní', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sydney', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ember', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Luis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ferré-Sadurní', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7483eaa1-cf2c-5a59-abee-5d7fd40d4f2a', 'word_count': 2237, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7483eaa1-cf2c-5a59-abee-5d7fd40d4f2a'}, {'abstract': 'Nancy Silverton helped design the new French bakeware line from Made In.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/12/dining/french-porcelain-bakeware.html', 'snippet': 'Nancy Silverton helped design the new French bakeware line from Made In.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Made In, the company that sells cookware directly to consumers, has introduced French porcelain baking dishes, manufactured by a company that has been in business for more than 200 years. The generous square, oval and rectangle pieces — available now and designed in collaboration with the chef Nancy Silverton — are white with a choice of red or blue trim along the edges. There are also limited-edition versions with an abstract floral design on the sides. They’re excellent for oven-to-table use, safe up to 500 degrees and suitable for the microwave. They can go in the dishwasher, but a good soak is what they need to erase crusty burned-on residue. The oval baker, 14.4 inches long, holds 2.6 quarts; the 12-inch square, 2.4 quarts; and the 17-inch rectangle, 5.3 quarts.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/dining/12BurnerDish02/12BurnerDish02-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/12/dining/12BurnerDish02/12BurnerDish02-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/dining/12BurnerDish02/12BurnerDish02-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/dining/12BurnerDish02/12BurnerDish02-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/dining/12BurnerDish02/12BurnerDish02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/12/dining/12BurnerDish02/12BurnerDish02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/dining/12BurnerDish02/12BurnerDish02-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New Porcelain Designed With the Chef in Mind', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Bake: New Porcelain Designed  With the Chef in Mind', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cookware', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-12T22:20:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/de111f37-fea3-5351-be58-672cffbd5005', 'word_count': 180, 'uri': 'nyt://article/de111f37-fea3-5351-be58-672cffbd5005'}, {'abstract': 'The Japan Society will host a virtual cocktail-making class in honor of the cherry blossoms.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/12/dining/drinks/cherry-blossom-cocktails.html', 'snippet': 'The Japan Society will host a virtual cocktail-making class in honor of the cherry blossoms.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Japan honoring sakura, cherry blossoms, is perennial in spring. For the occasion, the Japan Society has organized a virtual celebration with a Zoom class about sakura-themed sake cocktails, including Cherry Blossom Fizz, Sakura Highball and Ichigo Cocktail (ichigo means strawberry). Participants will receive the link in advance, with recipes, lists of ingredients and equipment, and recommended food pairings. The cocktails will be demonstrated by Chris Johnson, a sake expert, and Warren Hode, a mixologist.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/dining/14BurnerCherry-02/12BurnerCherry-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/14/dining/14BurnerCherry-02/12BurnerCherry-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/dining/14BurnerCherry-02/12BurnerCherry-02-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/dining/14BurnerCherry-02/12BurnerCherry-02-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/dining/14BurnerCherry-02/12BurnerCherry-02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/14/dining/14BurnerCherry-02/12BurnerCherry-02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/dining/14BurnerCherry-02/12BurnerCherry-02-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Make Sake Cocktails This Sakura Season', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Celebrate: Make Sake Cocktails  This Sakura Season', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Adult Education', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Japan Society', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name':