ict attorney race.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/13/nyregion/tali-farhadian-weinstein-wall-street-da-race.html', 'snippet': 'Tali Farhadian Weinstein built up a $2.2 million war chest with help from hedge fund managers, far more than her rivals in the Manhattan district attorney race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even had she not raised more money than her rivals, Tali Farhadian Weinstein would be a formidable candidate in the nine-way race to become the Manhattan district attorney, perhaps the most high-profile local prosecutor’s office in the country.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/nyregion/00farhadianweinstein-1/00farhadianweinstein-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/12/nyregion/00farhadianweinstein-1/00farhadianweinstein-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 414}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/nyregion/00farhadianweinstein-1/00farhadianweinstein-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 707, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/nyregion/00farhadianweinstein-1/00farhadianweinstein-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1414, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/12/nyregion/00farhadianweinstein-1/00farhadianweinstein-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/12/nyregion/00farhadianweinstein-1/00farhadianweinstei