News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7c683cf2-6853-535c-a1eb-1cc86a6e4d37', 'word_count': 1510, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7c683cf2-6853-535c-a1eb-1cc86a6e4d37'}, {'abstract': 'The Biden agenda tries to seize the populist opportunity that Trump let slip away.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/13/opinion/biden-trump-populism.html', 'snippet': 'The Biden agenda tries to seize the populist opportunity that Trump let slip away.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The intra-Democratic debate about Joe Biden’s presidency, so far, pits a growing camp of Biden enthusiasts who are harking back to liberalism’s golden age — comparing the new president’s free-spending ambitions to Franklin Roosevelt’s and Lyndon Johnson’s — against a shrinking cadre of leftists who insist that Biden is still just another neoliberal centrist, another Bill Clinton or Barack Obama.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/13/opinion/13douthat-lead/merlin_182247333_490a6abc-cbef-4e29-82c6-e77fb52e2686-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/13/opinion/13douthat-lead/merlin_182247333_490a6abc-cbef-4e29-82c6-e77fb52e2686-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/13/opinion/13douthat-lead/merlin_182247333_490a6abc-cbef-4e29-82c6-e77fb52e2686-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/13/opinion/13douthat-lead/merlin_182247333_490a6abc-cbef-4e29-82c6-e77fb52e2686-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1354, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None,