', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': '#MeToo Movement', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spitzer, Eliot L', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-13T09:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Flegenheimer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flegenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/91ea1f39-acc1-5c2e-b5d4-ca3213ffcea6', 'word_count': 8334, 'uri': 'nyt://article/91ea1f39-acc1-5c2e-b5d4-ca3213ffcea6'}, {'abstract': 'For the actor Vanessa Ray, what makes a one-bedroom near Lincoln Center feel homey are a few essentials: Bill Nye, blankets and one three-letter word.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2021/04/13/realestate/vanessa-ray-of-blue-bloods-on-what-makes-a-home.html', 'snippet': 'For the actor Vanessa Ray, what makes a one-bedroom near Lincoln Center feel homey are a few essentials: Bill Nye, blankets and one three-letter word.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the actor Vanessa Ray, what makes a one-bedroom near Lincoln Center feel homey are a few essentials: Bill Nye, blankets and one three-letter word.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/13/realestate/13WHATILOVE-RAY-slide-MTGM/13WHATILOVE-RAY-slide-MTGM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/13/realestate/13WHATILOVE-RAY-slide-MTGM/13WHATILOVE-RAY-slide-MTGM-artic