', 'byline': {'original': 'By Helene Cooper, Julian E. Barnes and Thomas Gibbons-Neff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Helene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Julian', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gibbons-Neff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8b7a813-ce48-5af4-b3a9-4540feca129a', 'word_count': 467, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8b7a813-ce48-5af4-b3a9-4540feca129a'}, {'abstract': 'The infielder tweeted about messages he received after a throwing mistake. The Mets swept their doubleheader with the Phillies, and the Yankees lost to Toronto.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/13/sports/baseball/yu-chang-mets-yankees.html', 'snippet': 'The infielder tweeted about messages he received after a throwing mistake. The Mets swept their doubleheader with the Phillies, and the Yankees lost to Toronto.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The morning after his throwing error led to his team’s losing a game to the Chicago White Sox, Cleveland’s Yu Chang tweeted on Tuesday about racist messages he had received on social media in reaction to the mistake.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/sports/13mlb-chang-print/merlin_186323355_70d96744-4d6d-4c6a-bbbf-140ed260d7b6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/14/sports/13mlb-chang-print/merlin_186323355_70d96744-4d6d-4c6a-bbbf-140ed260d7b6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank':