irstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sanders', 'qualifier': 'M.D', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/db7f086d-e673-5951-a5f3-e1c75a0596c0', 'word_count': 1455, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db7f086d-e673-5951-a5f3-e1c75a0596c0'}, {'abstract': 'She’s a fighter for civil rights. Of course Fox News is trying to smear her.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/14/opinion/tucker-carlson-kristen-clarke-voting-rights.html', 'snippet': 'She’s a fighter for civil rights. Of course Fox News is trying to smear her.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are few people in the country today who have more experience fighting in the judicial trenches to preserve civil rights than Kristen Clarke, President Biden’s nominee to head the civil rights division of the Department of Justice.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/opinion/14stockman/14stockman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/14/opinion/14stockman/14stockman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/opinion/14stockman/14stockman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/opinion/14stockman/14stockman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/opinion/14stockman/14stockman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTyp