ting a digital certificate of vaccination against the coronavirus is one of the hottest debates right now. What’s keeping it from happening, and why are some people opposed?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/14/travel/covid-vaccine-passport-excelsior-pass.html', 'snippet': 'Creating a digital certificate of vaccination against the coronavirus is one of the hottest debates right now. What’s keeping it from happening, and why are some people opposed?', 'lead_paragraph': 'With all American adults soon to be eligible for Covid-19 vaccines and businesses and international borders reopening, a fierce debate has kicked off across the United States over whether a digital health certificate (often and somewhat misleadingly called a “vaccine passport”) should be required to prove immunization status.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/13/travel/13vaccinepassport-explainer/merlin_186095907_431b73e0-76b8-4651-8237-5d4c9add7364-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/13/travel/13vaccinepassport-explainer/merlin_186095907_431b73e0-76b8-4651-8237-5d4c9add7364-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/13/travel/13vaccinepassport-explainer/merlin_186095907_431b73e0-76b8-4651-8237-5d4c9add7364-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/13/travel/13vaccinepassport-explainer/merlin_186095907_431b73e0-76b8-4651-8237-5d4c9add7364-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1441, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {