08ce-7845-57bc-bc20-c54a668aa622'}, {'abstract': 'With playhouses closed, theater fans have taken drama into their own hands and mouths, forming play reading groups online and off.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/14/theater/play-reading-groups-quarantine.html', 'snippet': 'With playhouses closed, theater fans have taken drama into their own hands and mouths, forming play reading groups online and off.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When England began its first lockdown about a year ago, a production of “Coriolanus” at the Crucible in Sheffield locked down, too. Suddenly at liberty, the actress Alex Young hung up her Junius Brutus costume and returned to London. She panicked, she grieved and then on March 18, she opened Twitter. “Who’d be up for a Zoom/Skype play reading group?” she wrote. “Like a book group but we chose a script each time.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/arts/18PLAY-READ1/18PLAY-READ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/18/arts/18PLAY-READ1/18PLAY-READ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/arts/18PLAY-READ1/18PLAY-READ1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/arts/18PLAY-READ1/18PLAY-READ1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/arts/18PLAY-READ1/18PLAY-READ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width