ng Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50cdf041-443b-5785-ad74-a89879005679', 'word_count': 158, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50cdf041-443b-5785-ad74-a89879005679'}, {'abstract': 'His enormous fraud left behind a devastating human toll and paper losses totaling $64.8 billion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/14/business/bernie-madoff-dead.html', 'snippet': 'His enormous fraud left behind a devastating human toll and paper losses totaling $64.8 billion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bernard L. Madoff, the onetime senior statesman of Wall Street who in 2008 became the human face of an era of financial misdeeds and missteps for running the largest and possibly most devastating Ponzi scheme in financial history, died on Wednesday in a federal prison hospital in Butner, N.C. He was 82.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/obituaries/14Madoff-top-sub/merlin_78045659_aef1e98f-18bf-4f9c-b5d3-dd58b2f365a2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/14/obituaries/14Madoff-top-sub/merlin_78045659_aef1e98f-18bf-4f9c-b5d3-dd58b2f365a2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/obituaries/14Madoff-top-sub/merlin_78045659_aef1e98f-18bf-4f9c-b5d3-dd58b2f365a2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 711, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/obituaries/14Madoff-top-sub/merlin_78045659_aef1e98f-18bf-4f9c-b5d3-dd58b2f365a2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1421, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thum