ame': 'subject', 'value': 'Skin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cosmetics and Toiletries', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-14T19:47:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'subsection_name': 'Self-Care', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ivy Manners', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ivy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Manners', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60889493-aead-565a-bdb2-a9f8417efe1b', 'word_count': 1097, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60889493-aead-565a-bdb2-a9f8417efe1b'}, {'abstract': 'Allies to follow U.S. out of Afghanistan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/14/briefing/15nato-afghanistan-johnson-vaccine-coinbase.html', 'snippet': 'Allies to follow U.S. out of Afghanistan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Now that the U.S. has decided to leave Afghanistan by Sept. 11, NATO’s foreign and defense ministers agreed on Wednesday to begin withdrawing their 9,600 troops on May 1 and finish “within a few months,” according to a statement. The alliance’s mantra has always been “in together, out together,” so with the U.S. leaving, the pullout does not come as a surprise.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/world/15ambriefing-Aus-NL-nato/merlin_140963922_658e81a9-8dd6-4c4d-88fd-c0a5b32c4354-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 386, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/14/world/15ambriefing-Aus-NL-nato/merlin_140963922_658e81a9-8dd6-4c4d-88fd-c0a5b32c4354-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 386}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/world/15ambriefing-Aus-NL-nato/merlin_140963922_658e81a9-8dd6-4c4d-88fd-c0a5b32c4354-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 658, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/world/15ambriefing-Aus-NL-nato/merlin_140963922_658e81a9-8dd6-4c4d-88fd-c0a5b32c4354-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1317, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/world/15ambriefing-Aus-NL-nato/14afghan-nato-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/14/world/15ambriefing-Aus-NL-nato/14afghan-nato-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/world/15ambriefing-Aus-NL-nato/14afghan-nato-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Your Thursday Briefing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-04-14T19:50:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NYTNow', 'section_name': 'Briefing', 'byline': {'original': 'By Whet Moser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Whet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'briefing', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d2d3bf6-8f7f-5a62-a7cf-8dd2ca5ec96c', 'word_count': 1195, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d2d3bf6-8f7f-5a62-a7cf-8dd2ca5ec96c'}, {'abstract': 'Vanessa Kirby’s Oscar-nominated performance involves an extended sequence that these experts say gets some things right — and a few wrong.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/14/movies/pieces-of-a-woman-midwives.html', 'snippet': 'Vanessa Kirby’s Oscar-nominated performance involves an extended sequence that these experts say gets some things right — and a few wrong.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the movies, birth is usually an emergency. It begins with the woman’s water breaking, at the worst possible moment. She appears to be barely in labor, and yet she is rushed, through gridlock traffic, to the hospital. There she becomes angry, and the pain is her husband’s fault. She yells at him, perhaps even injures him, and orders him to get a vasectomy. Then she begs for an epidural, but for some reason, she can’t have it. After four minutes of intense screaming, she’s handed something that looks like the Gerber baby.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/17/arts/13midwives-movie1/13midwives-movie1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/17/arts/13midwives-movie1/13midwives-movie1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 324}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/17/arts/13midwives-movie1/13midwives-movie1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 554, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/17/arts/13midwives-movie1/13midwives-movie1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1107, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/17/arts/13midwives-movie1/13midwives-movie1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/17/arts/13midwives-movie1/13midwives-movie1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/17/arts/13midwives-movie1/13midwives-movie1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Pieces of a Woman’ Has Midwives Talking About That Birth Scene', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Checking In With Midwives on a Birth Scene', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Pieces of a Woman (Movie)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midwives and Doulas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kirby, Vanessa (1988- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-14T19:52:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bianca Giaever', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bianca', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Giaever', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b699e01b-a034-51ba-8857-a576a33085f5', 'word_count': 1175, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b699e01b-a034-51ba-8857-a576a33085f5'}, {'abstract': 'The risk of exposure on a flight is lowered by 23 to 57 percent if middle seats are kept unoccupied, according to the study. But it did not look at what protection mask-wearing could provide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/14/health/covid-plane-middle-seat.html', 'snippet': 'The r