7a0-93bc-02036256716b'}, {'abstract': 'The first medical expert called by Derek Chauvin’s defense team said George Floyd died after a combination of factors — including pre-existing heart conditions, drug use and exposure to vehicle exhaust from the police cruiser — caused his death. He faced difficult cross-examination.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/14/us/takeaways-day-13-derek-chauvin-trial.html', 'snippet': 'The first medical expert called by Derek Chauvin’s defense team said George Floyd died after a combination of factors — including pre-existing heart conditions, drug use and exposure to vehicle exhaust from the police cruiser — caused his death. H...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first medical expert witness called by Derek Chauvin’s defense team faced difficult cross-examination on Wednesday after he testified that George Floyd died from sudden cardiac arrhythmia, rather than a deprivation of oxygen caused by Mr. Chauvin.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/us/14derek-chauvin-trial-blog-takeaways-Day-13-fowler/merlin_186405753_a46e3482-293f-4f8a-8a91-fa7086357edd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/14/us/14derek-chauvin-trial-blog-takeaways-Day-13-fowler/merlin_186405753_a46e3482-293f-4f8a-8a91-fa7086357edd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/us/14derek-chauvin-trial-blog-takeaways-Day-13-fowler/merlin_186405753_a46e3482-293f-4f8a-8a91-fa7086357edd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/us/14derek-chauvin-trial-blog-takeaways-Day