he made in 1946 and one of her singing at her wedding reception in 1953. They included jazz standards like “Nobody’s Baby,” “Can’t Help Loving That Man of Mine,” “Begin the Beguine” and Yiddish classics like “Oy Mama!” It was her voice, but from another era.', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/nyregion/18forties-singer/merlin_186412794_f657b32d-019e-44a8-a675-2e46d6f43bc5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/18/nyregion/18forties-singer/merlin_186412794_f657b32d-019e-44a8-a675-2e46d6f43bc5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/nyregion/18forties-singer/merlin_186412794_f657b32d-019e-44a8-a675-2e46d6f43bc5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/nyregion/18forties-singer/merlin_186412794_f657b32d-019e-44a8-a675-2e46d6f43bc5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/nyregion/18forties-singer/16forties-singer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/18/nyregion/18forties-singer/16forties-singer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/nyregion/18forties-singer/16forties-singer-thumbLarge.jpg', 'hei