word_count': 2792, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2185b736-bb87-530e-85e6-d93b486756e4'}, {'abstract': 'A study by a liberal group found a reverse coattails effect in 2020: Down-ballot candidates may have helped elect President Biden, rather than the other way around.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/16/us/politics/democrats-down-ballot.html', 'snippet': 'A study by a liberal group found a reverse coattails effect in 2020: Down-ballot candidates may have helped elect President Biden, rather than the other way around.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ebony Carter faced an uphill climb when she decided to run for the Georgia State House last year. Her deeply Republican district south of Atlanta had not elected a Democrat since 2001, and a Democrat hadn’t even bothered campaigning for the seat since 2014.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/us/politics/00dem-coattails/merlin_181977654_80b78e4e-a2c7-4160-9d5c-0295591dc00e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/14/us/politics/00dem-coattails/merlin_181977654_80b78e4e-a2c7-4160-9d5c-0295591dc00e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/us/politics/00dem-coattails/merlin_181977654_80b78e4e-a2c7-4160-9d5c-0295591dc00e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 717, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/14/us/politics/00dem-coattails/merlin_181977654_80b78e4e-a2c7-4160-9d5c-0295591dc00e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1433, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbna