nt': 401, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6e6adc50-4f78-5a4a-9ab6-f8a692a4f149'}, {'abstract': 'Public health experts have said the move is desperately needed to help forestall another devastating surge of coronavirus cases.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/16/us/coronavirus-variant-track.html', 'snippet': 'Public health experts have said the move is desperately needed to help forestall another devastating surge of coronavirus cases.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The White House on Friday announced an almost $2 billion plan for expanding and improving the nation’s ability to track coronavirus variants, an effort that public health experts have said is desperately needed to fight against variants that could drive another wave or potentially undermine the effectiveness of vaccines.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The White House details a nearly $2 billion plan to enhance the tracking of variants.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'internal-essential', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'American Rescue Plan (2021)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-16T16:24:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Noah Weiland and Carl Zimmer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Noah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Carl', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zimmer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa49d4d4-6eb1-5e22-9d92-79ff0706b6a3', 'word_count': 778, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa49d4d4-6eb1-5e22-9d92-79ff0706b6a3'}, {'abstract': 'Sometimes, you just need a little more pasta: Pair it with garlicky spinach or feta and tomatoes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/16/dining/weeknight-pasta-times-two.html', 'snippet': 'Sometimes, you just need a little more pasta: Pair it with garlicky spinach or feta and tomatoes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hi, everyone! Margaux Laskey here filling in for Emily this week. It’s a stunningly beautiful spring day where I am, like a Gerda Muller picture book come to life (except with sirens and aggressive pigeons). There’s a whisper of chill in the air, but the sun is bright, and I’m thinking this might be the weekend I plant pansies and begonias in my front porch pots. Maybe I won’t kill them this year. I am feeling hopeful about so many things. I wish that for you, too.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/dining/15Pasta-Garlicy-Greens-a/merlin_171317172_21b69335-b095-419e-bd54-302ddf6fa0dc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/18/dining/15Pasta-Garlicy-Greens-a/merlin_171317172_21b69335-b095-419e-bd54-302ddf6fa0dc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/dining/15Pasta-Garlicy-Greens-a/merlin_171317172_21b69335-b095-419e-bd54-302ddf6fa0dc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/dining/15Pasta-Garlicy-Greens-a/merlin_17131717