omedy and Humor', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantine (Life and Culture)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Das, Vir', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Ten on Ten (TV Program)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Regan, Brian (1957- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'On the Rocks (TV Program)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rhodes, Erica (1983- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'La Vie en Rhodes (TV Program)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Steinberg, Ester', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Burning Bush (TV Program)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-16T17:10:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jason Zinoman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jason', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinoman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa7fdbc4-5b5a-5e2d-bd06-d81b1650e417', 'word_count': 1100, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa7fdbc4-5b5a-5e2d-bd06-d81b1650e417'}, {'abstract': 'Putting a risk in context: The rate of blood clots is extremely low, but the pause in the Johnson & Johnson vaccine could reveal more cases.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/16/upshot/vaccine-safety-analysis.html', 'snippet': 'Putting a risk in context: The rate of blood clots is extremely low, but the pause in the Johnson & Johnson vaccine could reveal more cases.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When federal officials paused administration of the Johnson & Johnson vaccine after six cases of a rare clotting disorder, one fatal, among the 6.9 million peopl