nytimes.com/2021/04/16/us/politics/biden-5g-japan.html', 'snippet': 'The subtext of the meeting was responding to China’s influence and its aggressive actions in the Indo-Pacific and beyond, and Prime Minister Yoshihide Suga resisted being drawn into a rivalry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Biden and Prime Minister Yoshihide Suga of Japan pledged on Friday to work jointly on the rapid development of 5G communications technologies to prevent one of China’s leading companies from dominating the global market, a symbolic first move at shoring up an alliance that withered during the Trump administration.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/16/us/politics/16dc-biden-1/merlin_186503457_c7f75936-ba5c-4a55-b830-95261bc63af4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/16/us/politics/16dc-biden-1/merlin_186503457_c7f75936-ba5c-4a55-b830-95261bc63af4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/16/us/politics/16dc-biden-1/merlin_186503457_c7f75936-ba5c-4a55-b830-95261bc63af4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/16/us/politics/16dc-biden-1/merlin_186503457_c7f75936-ba5c-4a55-b830-95261bc63af4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/16/us/politics/16dc-biden-1/merlin_186503457_c7f75936-ba5c-4a55-b830-95261bc63af4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'w