 States and Europe have reverberated around the world, undercutting faith in two sorely needed shots and threatening to prolong the coronavirus pandemic in poorer countries that cannot afford to be choosy about vaccines. With new infections surging on nearly every continent, signs that the vaccination drive is in peril are emerging, most disconcertingly in the continent of Africa.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/17/multimedia/17virus-briefing-whatwelearned/merlin_185839098_c575bcfb-3d8b-4739-83b0-d01b0d63286f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/17/multimedia/17virus-briefing-whatwelearned/merlin_185839098_c575bcfb-3d8b-4739-83b0-d01b0d63286f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/17/multimedia/17virus-briefing-whatwelearned/merlin_185839098_c575bcfb-3d8b-4739-83b0-d01b0d63286f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/17/multimedia/17virus-briefing-whatwelearned/merlin_185839098_c575bcfb-3d8b-4739-83b0-d01b0d63286f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/17/multimedia/17virus-briefing-whatwelearned/17virus-briefing-whatwelearned-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/17/multimedia/17virus-briefing-whatwelearned/17virus-briefing-whatwelearned-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth':