', 'byline': {'original': 'By A-J Aronstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A-j', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Aronstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/3a7cd1d4-6d13-5060-9c01-aaf9aaaab798', 'word_count': 1186, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a7cd1d4-6d13-5060-9c01-aaf9aaaab798'}, {'abstract': 'We must reckon with Margaret Sanger’s association with white supremacist groups and eugenics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/17/opinion/planned-parenthood-margaret-sanger.html', 'snippet': 'We must reckon with Margaret Sanger’s association with white supremacist groups and eugenics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We need to talk about Margaret Sanger.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/20/opinion/20Johnson-inyt/16Johnson-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/20/opinion/20Johnson-inyt/16Johnson-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/20/opinion/20Johnson-inyt/16Johnson-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/20/opinion/20Johnson-inyt/16Johnson-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/20/opinion/20Johnson-inyt/16Johnson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/20/opinion