'Qualms about the vaccines’ development are not entirely misguided. But we can make amends for past injustice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'America is rapidly approaching the point where demand, not supply, is the limiting factor of our vaccine rollout. Our job now is hearing out the worries of vaccine-hesitant friends and trying to assuage their concerns. My fellow Catholics are one group in need of assurance.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/19/opinion/19libresco-inyt/17libresco-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/19/opinion/19libresco-inyt/17libresco-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/19/opinion/19libresco-inyt/17libresco-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/19/opinion/19libresco-inyt/17libresco-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1295, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/19/opinion/19libresco-inyt/17libresco-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/19/opinion/19libresco-inyt/17libresco-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/19/opinion/19libresco-inyt/17libresco-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Why Anti-Abortion Catholics Should Get Vaccinated', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Abortion', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Johnson & Johnson', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pfizer Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lacks, Henrietta', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-17T15:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Leah Libresco Sargeant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Leah', 'middlename': 'Libresco', 'lastname': 'Sargeant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/6acef8a5-5e60-5882-ba2f-fb7de557c817', 'word_count': 1252, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6acef8a5-5e60-5882-ba2f-fb7de557c817'}, {'abstract': 'Germany’s Greens are expected to be a critical part of any new government. But these are not the Greens of old. Today it is a pragmatic party promising an assertive stance abroad.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/17/world/europe/germany-green-party-merkel.html', 'snippet': 'Germany’s Greens are expected to be a critical part of any new government. But these are not the Greens of old. Today it is a pragmatic party promising an assertive stance abroad.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Whatever government fills the vacuum in Germany after Chancellor Angela Merkel will be tinged with green.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'capt