ys others will directly run his shows.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/17/theater/scott-rudin-bullying-broadway.html', 'snippet': 'The powerful producer of “Hello, Dolly!” and “The Book of Mormon” regrets “the pain my behavior caused” and says others will directly run his shows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Scott Rudin, a powerful Broadway producer facing renewed accusations of bullying, apologized Saturday for “troubling interactions with colleagues” and said he would step aside from “active participation” in his current shows.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/17/arts/17rudin/merlin_186176976_ccdce95b-3694-4427-84f4-a52b3f5109ce-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 776, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/17/arts/17rudin/merlin_186176976_ccdce95b-3694-4427-84f4-a52b3f5109ce-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 776}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/17/arts/17rudin/merlin_186176976_ccdce95b-3694-4427-84f4-a52b3f5109ce-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 792, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/17/arts/17rudin/merlin_186176976_ccdce95b-3694-4427-84f4-a52b3f5109ce-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1584, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/17/arts/17rudin/17rudin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/17/arts/17rudin/17rudin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight