ion’s push to combat domestic extremism, embodied most publicly in the department’s inquiry into the Capitol attack.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/17/us/politics/lisa-monaco-justice-department.html', 'snippet': 'Lisa Monaco, a veteran of national security posts, is expected to be a key player in the administration’s push to combat domestic extremism, embodied most publicly in the department’s inquiry into the Capitol attack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Lisa Monaco was President Barack Obama’s top counterterrorism adviser when she was handed an intractable problem: Fix the administration’s ineffective response to the kidnappings of Americans by Islamic State fighters, which had prompted outcries from victims’ families, without changing the government’s refusal to make concessions to terrorists.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/us/politics/18dc-monaco-print1/merlin_184801749_aad13e27-7185-41e1-8ae1-8348d3042cee-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/18/us/politics/18dc-monaco-print1/merlin_184801749_aad13e27-7185-41e1-8ae1-8348d3042cee-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/us/politics/18dc-monaco-print1/merlin_184801749_aad13e27-7185-41e1-8ae1-8348d3042cee-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/us/politics/18dc-monaco-print1/merlin_184801749_aad13e27-7185-41e1-8ae1-8348d3042cee-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}