ed. This Earth Day (Thursday), make a resolution to learn more about our collective planetary problems, along with possible solutions in the form of audio. There’s a sea of informative climate podcasts out there — in fact, a grass-roots movement has issued an open letter challenging Apple Podcasts to add a climate category to its many classifications — but these five audio journeys of climate storytelling are all fabulous places to start.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/podcasts/18AH-PODCAST-GRID/18AH-PODCAST_GRID-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/18/podcasts/18AH-PODCAST-GRID/18AH-PODCAST_GRID-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 601}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/podcasts/18AH-PODCAST-GRID/18AH-PODCAST_GRID-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1023, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/podcasts/18AH-PODCAST-GRID/18AH-PODCAST_GRID-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 1998, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/podcasts/18AH-PODCAST-GRID/18AH-PODCAST_GRID-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/18/podcasts/18AH-PODCAST-GRID/18AH-PODCAST_GRID-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/18/podcasts/18AH-PO