, 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://audiocontainer/50776625-795b-5adc-a5fd-8fd66563adfe', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audiocontainer/50776625-795b-5adc-a5fd-8fd66563adfe'}, {'abstract': 'The psychologist Simon McCarthy-Jones writes about the different varieties of spite, and argues that the emotion “can be a force for good,” if deployed strategically.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/20/books/spite-simon-mccarthy-jones.html', 'snippet': 'The psychologist Simon McCarthy-Jones writes about the different varieties of spite, and argues that the emotion “can be a force for good,” if deployed strategically.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A recent viral YouTube video shows a woman’s epic struggle to parallel park her car. She approaches from behind; she approaches from the front; she tries again, fails again; she gets out and attempts to measure the space with her feet. Finally, a good Samaritan steps in, shouting encouragement and motivational remarks while patiently directing her into the spot.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/21/books/review/20BOOKMCCARTHY-JONES2/20BOOKMCCARTHY-JONES2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/21/books/review/20BOOKMCCARTHY-JONES2/20BOOKMCCARTHY-JONES2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 923}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/21/books/review/20BOOKMCCARTHY-JONES2/20BOOKMCCARTHY-JONES2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 666, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/21/books/review/20BOOKMCCARTHY-JONES2/20BOOKMCCARTHY-JONE