ading to a shortage of cars and sticker shock for travelers. Here are some tips for finding an affordable one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On March 31, the day before he moved from San Diego, Calif., to Austin, Texas, Clay Hebert went shopping for a rental car. Before the pandemic, Mr. Hebert, a marketing strategist who frequently travels for work, was used to paying about $400 a week for a rental. To his surprise, Thrifty, Dollar, National and Alamo were sold out, and Hertz wanted $1,212 for a compact Mazda for a week.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/22/business/00rentalcars/00rentalcars-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/22/business/00rentalcars/00rentalcars-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/22/business/00rentalcars/00rentalcars-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 614, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/22/business/00rentalcars/00rentalcars-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1229, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/22/business/00rentalcars/00rentalcars-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/22/business/00rentalcars/00rentalcars-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/22/b