tle': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4314671a-60dc-5e31-9b2e-e97f26185de6', 'word_count': 1137, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4314671a-60dc-5e31-9b2e-e97f26185de6'}, {'abstract': 'The widow and inspiration of the provocative photographer Helmut Newton, she took pictures that were as tender as his were erotically charged.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/21/arts/june-newton-dead.html', 'snippet': 'The widow and inspiration of the provocative photographer Helmut Newton, she took pictures that were as tender as his were erotically charged.', 'lead_paragraph': 'June Newton, the widow, muse and collaborator of Helmut Newton, the fashion photographer and provocateur known as “the King of Kink” for his erotically charged tableaux of Amazonian women — and, under the name Alice Springs, a photographer in her own right — died on April 9 at a hospital in Monte Carlo. She was 97.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/24/obituaries/19Newton1/19Newton1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/24/obituaries/19Newton1/19Newton1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/24/obituaries/19Newton1/19Newton1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/24/obituaries/19Newton1/19Newton1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, '