abstract': 'The gripping PBS documentary series is a richly detailed look at what happens when an idealist gets actual power.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/22/arts/television/review-philly-da-pbs.html', 'snippet': 'The gripping PBS documentary series is a richly detailed look at what happens when an idealist gets actual power.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Philly D.A.,” a new documentary series from “Independent Lens” on PBS, never steps inside a courtroom. There are no surprise witnesses, no brutal cross-examinations, no stunning verdicts. But it’s as captivating, timely and relevant a legal drama as you’re likely to watch this spring.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/22/arts/22phillyda/merlin_186724797_bb7bd630-2644-4796-9fd2-13762e3657f8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 316, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/22/arts/22phillyda/merlin_186724797_bb7bd630-2644-4796-9fd2-13762e3657f8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 316}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/22/arts/22phillyda/merlin_186724797_bb7bd630-2644-4796-9fd2-13762e3657f8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 540, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/22/arts/22phillyda/merlin_186724797_bb7bd630-2644-4796-9fd2-13762e3657f8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/22/arts/22phillyda/22phillyda-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/20