}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/95cc833b-05f8-5c95-a060-81a4fbfee213', 'word_count': 1249, 'uri': 'nyt://article/95cc833b-05f8-5c95-a060-81a4fbfee213'}, {'abstract': 'Central Illinois, which saw major growth in cases earlier this month, is now improving — especially in Peoria, one of the metropolitan areas where the virus had been spreading the fastest.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/23/us/illinois-covid-cases.html', 'snippet': 'Central Illinois, which saw major growth in cases earlier this month, is now improving — especially in Peoria, one of the metropolitan areas where the virus had been spreading the fastest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For weeks, Illinois, like much of the Upper Midwest, has been troubled by a stubbornly high daily load of reported coronavirus cases, leading to climbing numbers of hospitalizations and deaths. But new data is signaling that the virus might be on the verge of retreating.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/22/us/22virus-briefing-ILLINOIS/merlin_186348708_36aa7f3a-a766-4094-9b40-d2651e44e1fa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/22/us/22virus-briefing-ILLINOIS/merlin_186348708_36aa7f3a-a766-4094-9b40-d2651e44e1fa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/22/us/22virus-briefing-ILLINOIS/merlin_186348708_36aa7f3a-a766-4094-9b40-d2651e44e1fa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/22/us/22virus-briefing-ILLINOIS/merlin_186348708_36aa7f3a-a766-4094-9b40-d2651e44e1fa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width