 countries is Pride month.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/23/us/us-embassy-pride-flag.html', 'snippet': 'The action reversed a decision by the Trump administration, which rejected requests from embassies to raise it on their flag poles during the month of June, which in the United States and many other countries is Pride month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Secretary of State Antony J. Blinken has authorized U.S. diplomatic missions across the world to fly the rainbow pride flag on the same pole as the American flag at embassies and consulates, according to a State Department cable reviewed by The New York Times.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/23/us/23new-washington-briefing-state-pride-1/merlin_173534901_52f58c49-d5d5-44f3-9dff-dc694310887c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/23/us/23new-washington-briefing-state-pride-1/merlin_173534901_52f58c49-d5d5-44f3-9dff-dc694310887c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/23/us/23new-washington-briefing-state-pride-1/merlin_173534901_52f58c49-d5d5-44f3-9dff-dc694310887c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/23/us/23new-washington-briefing-state-pride-1/merlin_173534901_52f58c49-d5d5-44f3-9dff-dc694310887c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/23/us/23new-washington-briefing-state-pri