flout convention, but a litany of cozy dealings between the government and business is beginning to take its toll.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/23/world/europe/britain-lobbying-laws-johnson-sleaze.html', 'snippet': 'The prime minister likes to flout convention, but a litany of cozy dealings between the government and business is beginning to take its toll.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Still riding high from Britain’s successful vaccine rollout and a politically shrewd campaign to kill off a proposed European soccer super league, Prime Minister Boris Johnson now confronts thorny questions about how he and other senior officials have dealt with efforts to lobby the government.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/26/world/26UK-BORIS1/merlin_186756189_3409aa8f-d92d-42ca-9850-ef612575b1fa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/26/world/26UK-BORIS1/merlin_186756189_3409aa8f-d92d-42ca-9850-ef612575b1fa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/26/world/26UK-BORIS1/merlin_186756189_3409aa8f-d92d-42ca-9850-ef612575b1fa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/26/world/26UK-BORIS1/merlin_186756189_3409aa8f-d92d-42ca-9850-ef612575b1fa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/26/world/26UK-BORIS1/26UK-BORIS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75,