'abstract': 'After the Trump presidency, democracy activists and many Democrats seized a moment to rebuild constitutional guardrails, but the effort could die in the face of a larger fight over voting rights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/24/us/politics/trump-ethics-voting-rights.html', 'snippet': 'After the Trump presidency, democracy activists and many Democrats seized a moment to rebuild constitutional guardrails, but the effort could die in the face of a larger fight over voting rights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — After Donald J. Trump lost the election and was impeached for his role in the Capitol riot, democracy preservation groups pointed with urgency to what they called a last, best chance to address the holes in the Constitution exposed by his presidency.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/25/us/politics/25dc-ethics-print1/merlin_185495871_ca18c1a3-cfba-4ccd-9c94-6de617de805e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/25/us/politics/25dc-ethics-print1/merlin_185495871_ca18c1a3-cfba-4ccd-9c94-6de617de805e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/25/us/politics/25dc-ethics-print1/merlin_185495871_ca18c1a3-cfba-4ccd-9c94-6de617de805e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/25/us/politics/25dc-ethics-print1/merlin_185495871_ca18c1a3-cfba-4ccd-9c94-6de617de805e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thum