ahr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bahr', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/148d9fc6-9856-5677-9b75-d1f5128963f2', 'word_count': 274, 'uri': 'nyt://article/148d9fc6-9856-5677-9b75-d1f5128963f2'}, {'abstract': 'The filmmaker behind “Nomadland” has been winning all season long and is already at work on her next project, the superhero team-up “Eternals.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/25/movies/chloe-zhao-nomadland-best-director.html', 'snippet': 'The filmmaker behind “Nomadland” has been winning all season long and is already at work on her next project, the superhero team-up “Eternals.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chloé Zhao on Sunday became the first woman of color, first Chinese woman and second woman ever to win the Oscar for directing, capping off a historically impressive run of honors she has amassed this awards season for her work on the drama “Nomadland.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/25/arts/25oscars-live-blog-chloe-zhao1/merlin_185514201_875e9cf0-50a9-44cd-8740-777e8fefaced-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/25/arts/25oscars-live-blog-chloe-zhao1/merlin_185514201_875e9cf0-50a9-44cd-8740-777e8fefaced-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/25/arts/25oscars-live-blog-chloe-zhao1/merlin_185514201_875e9cf0-50a9-44cd-8740-777e8fefaced-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/25/arts/