}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fab90a9b-8fc9-5b8f-918e-035c43826cb9', 'word_count': 562, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fab90a9b-8fc9-5b8f-918e-035c43826cb9'}, {'abstract': 'Born in Japan and a hit around the world, the recipe-sharing site has been less successful in America. Yet it has a small, fervent following among immigrants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/26/dining/cookpad-recipe-site.html', 'snippet': 'Born in Japan and a hit around the world, the recipe-sharing site has been less successful in America. Yet it has a small, fervent following among immigrants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are unspoken expectations the digital realm tends to place on recipes: They should photograph beautifully. They should have the mass appeal to go viral. And they should be written by a charismatic cook with a huge Instagram following and an adorable dog.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/dining/26Cookpad-6/26Cookpad-6-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/28/dining/26Cookpad-6/26Cookpad-6-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/dining/26Cookpad-6/26Cookpad-6-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/dining/26Cookpad-6/26Cookpad-6-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/dining/26Cookpad-6/26Cookpad-6-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/28/dining/26Cookpad-6/26Cookpad-6-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/dining/26Cookpad-6/26Cookpad-6-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With No Frills or Celebrities, Cookpad Is a Global Go-To for Recipes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A No-Frills Global Go-To for Recipes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cookpad Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-26T09:00:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Priya Krishna', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Priya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krishna', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8fa3bc85-9aa2-51b4-bf6c-450015daf404', 'word_count': 1783, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8fa3bc85-9aa2-51b4-bf6c-450015daf404'}, {'abstract': 'We’ve shown you Sweden in snow. Now see it in bloom.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/26/travel/sweden-spring-summer.html', 'snippet': 'We’ve shown you Sweden in snow. Now see it in bloom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For as long as I can rememb