 striven to convey a sense of normalcy during a period of profound turmoil, holding a series of tightly controlled events where he is often surrounded by aides or supporters, and seldom by reporters.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/26/nyregion/26nycuomo/26nycuomo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/26/nyregion/26nycuomo/26nycuomo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/26/nyregion/26nycuomo/26nycuomo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/26/nyregion/26nycuomo/26nycuomo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/26/nyregion/26nycuomo/26nycuomo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/26/nyregion/26nycuomo/26nycuomo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/26/nyregion/26nycuomo/26nycuomo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cuomo, in Rare Public Appearance, Says: ‘I Didn’t Do Anything Wrong’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cuomo, in Rare Public Appearance, Says, ‘I Didn’t Do Anything Wrong’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syracuse (NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics and Official Misconduct', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-26T21:33:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jesse McKinley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jesse', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe57ea80-6386-5933-9e6b-a8fd61aa0266', 'word_count': 851, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe57ea80-6386-5933-9e6b-a8fd61aa0266'}, {'abstract': 'How a pair of siblings, he an architect and she a fashion designer, worked together to help shape their father’s latest study in soothing minimalism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/26/t-magazine/majorca-wellness-retreat.html', 'snippet': 'How a pair of siblings, he an architect and she a fashion designer, worked together to help shape their father’s latest study in soothing minimalism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are architects who have shaped certain places in such singular and profound ways — Luis Barragán and Mexico City, Albert Frey and Palm Springs — that it’s hard to think of one without the other. Increasingly, the same is true of Antoni Esteva and Majorca, situated some 130 miles from the Spanish mainland in the sapphire waters of the Mediterranean. Over the past five decades, Esteva, who was born on the island, has dreamed up or transformed dozens of its buildings, from the local artist Miquel Barceló’s home and atelier — which incorporates a 13th-century lookout tower — to the reimagined 18th-century farmhouse that holds the cultish country hotel Son Gener. In 2010, he embarked on a restoration of the artist Joan Miró’s former home in Palma, Majorca’s capital, reorienting the rooms so as to redirect the gaze to the garden. If there is a common thread running through his work, it’s his fondness for employing natural materials and the resulting structures’ tendency to complement, and sometimes even disappear into, the landscape.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/23/t-magazine/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/23/t-magazine/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/23/t-magazine/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/23/t-magazine/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/23/t-magazine/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/23/t-magazine/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/23/t-magazine/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG/23tmag-es-raco-slide-BYMG-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On Majorca, a Wellness Retreat Whose Design Was a Family Affair', 'kicker': 'Two by Design', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Majorca (Spain)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Esteva, Antoni', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Esteva, Tomeu', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Esteva, Rosa', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Content Type: Personal Profile', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spas', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hotels and Travel Lodgings', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-26T21:40:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gisela Williams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gisela', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Williams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/75765e21-a3cc-54a2-97b2-8730886c2d88', 'word_count': 1410, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75765e21-a3cc-54a2-97b2-8730886c2d88'}, {'abstract': 'Africa’s slow vaccine rollout could endanger millions of lives — on and off the continent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/26/us/africa-vaccine-coronavirus-covax-rollout.html', 'snippet': 'Africa’s slow vaccine rollout 