 'article', 'news_desk': 'Books', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexandra Alter and Jennifer Schuessler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexandra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schuessler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3f7e8eff-c3ee-5560-a2ea-38c313d13fb4', 'word_count': 865, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3f7e8eff-c3ee-5560-a2ea-38c313d13fb4'}, {'abstract': 'Vaccinated people can often skip masks outdoors when they won’t be in crowded situations with strangers, the new guidance says, but unvaccinated people should still wear them in many outdoor settings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/27/health/cdc-outdoor-mask-wearing.html', 'snippet': 'Vaccinated people can often skip masks outdoors when they won’t be in crowded situations with strangers, the new guidance says, but unvaccinated people should still wear them in many outdoor settings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The new guidance on mask-wearing from the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention on Tuesday says that masks can be shed for some relatively safe outdoor activities, especially by fully vaccinated people, because the virus does not spread readily outdoors.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/us/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/27/us/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/us/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/us/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/us/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/27/us/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/us/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2/27virus-briefing-cdc-list2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When do we have to wear a mask outside? The C.D.C. says less often, and here’s how and why.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Masks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Content Type: Service', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus Risks and Safety Concerns', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'internal-essential', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-27T19:26:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_des