: 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/38cae6c6-037e-5a31-a136-eab71b979a15', 'word_count': 387, 'uri': 'nyt://article/38cae6c6-037e-5a31-a136-eab71b979a15'}, {'abstract': 'After working as a well-paid Republican operative, he gave up a lavish lifestyle to live in poverty as a self-proclaimed Jeremiah, calling out fraud in the name of God.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/27/us/ole-anthony-dead.html', 'snippet': 'After working as a well-paid Republican operative, he gave up a lavish lifestyle to live in poverty as a self-proclaimed Jeremiah, calling out fraud in the name of God.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ole Anthony, a former Air Force intelligence specialist and Texas political operative who found Jesus in 1972, built a following among the down-and-out of east Dallas, and then used that movement to take down a rogue’s gallery of unscrupulous televangelists and faith healers, died on April 16 at a house in Dallas that he shared with several members of his organization, the Trinity Foundation. He was 82.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/obituaries/Anthony-02/merlin_186806457_12426081-fde4-4237-b7b4-e80fee8a8b79-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 537, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/28/obituaries/Anthony-02/merlin_186806457_12426081-fde4-4237-b7b4-e80fee8a8b79-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 537}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/obituaries/Anthony-02/merlin_186806457_12426081-fde4-4237-b7b4-e80fee8a8b79-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 916, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/obituaries/Anthony-02/merlin_186