 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1f2cbc1-3d36-59d6-a187-7f490f2ab330'}, {'abstract': 'The tense encounters come as the two countries have resumed talks over renewing the 2015 nuclear agreement. The latest episode ended only after an American warship fired warning shots.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/27/us/politics/iran-united-states-navy-persian-gulf-encounters.html', 'snippet': 'The tense encounters come as the two countries have resumed talks over renewing the 2015 nuclear agreement. The latest episode ended only after an American warship fired warning shots.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — For the second time in a month, vessels from Iran and the United States came dangerously close in the Persian Gulf on Monday night, the Navy said on Tuesday, escalating tensions between the two nations as their negotiators have resumed talks toward renewing the 2015 nuclear deal.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/us/politics/27dc-navy/27dc-navy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/27/us/politics/27dc-navy/27dc-navy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/us/politics/27dc-navy/27dc-navy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/us/politics/27dc-navy/27dc-navy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/us/politics/27dc-navy/27dc-navy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/27/us/politics/27dc-navy/27dc-navy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/us/politics/27dc-navy/27dc-navy-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Second Close Call Between Iranian and American Vessels Raises Tensions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Second Close Call Between Iranian and American Vessels Raises Tensions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic Revolutionary Guards Corps', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Quds Force', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Navy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Coast Guard', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khamenei, Ali', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Suleimani, Qassim', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zarif, Mohammad Javad', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Persian Gulf', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-04-27T22:24:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Schmitt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schmitt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f8cfb78f-d9fb-5cb7-a89f-bf1d8dcb802d', 'word_count': 672, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f8cfb78f-d9fb-5cb7-a89f-bf1d8dcb802d'}, {'abstract': 'The rule had been criticized by many, including the restaurant industry and many Republican lawmakers, as arbitrary and an unfair regulation for bars that weren’t used to serving food.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/27/nyregion/covid-cuomo-alcohol-food-rule.html', 'snippet': 'The rule had been criticized by many, including the restaurant industry and many Republican lawmakers, as arbitrary and an unfair regulation for bars that weren’t used to serving food.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The leaders of the New York State Legislature said Tuesday they would move on the next day to suspend a  pandemic directive that required customers to order food when purchasing alcohol at bars and restaurants.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/us/27virus-briefing-nyupdate/merlin_174295452_9b0824f1-5ba5-4f41-8c1c-de543d97e996-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/27/us/27virus-briefing-nyupdate/merlin_174295452_9b0824f1-5ba5-4f41-8c1c-de543d97e996-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/us/27virus-briefing-nyupdate/merlin_174295452_9b0824f1-5ba5-4f41-8c1c-de543d97e996-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/us/27virus-briefing-nyupdate/merlin_174295452_9b0824f1-5ba5-4f41-8c1c-de543d97e996-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank'