bum be damned.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/28/arts/music/songs-remixes-lil-nas-x-spotemgottem.html', 'snippet': 'Recent hits by SpotemGottem and Lil Nas X show the power of extending the life of a single track, album be damned.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Beat Box,” by the young Florida rapper SpotemGottem — a thunderous, pulsing sneer of a track — was released just over a year ago. It bubbled lightly throughout the summer and fall, and then in December came a remix, “Beat Box 2,” with the rising Memphis star Pooh Shiesty. Not long after, on Dec. 23, a dancer named Junebug posted a video doing an exaggeratedly comic shimmy dance step to the song. Called the #JunebugChallenge, it spread wildly on TikTok, replicated in oodles of videos.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/arts/28ongoing-songs2/28ongoing-songs2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 206, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/28/arts/28ongoing-songs2/28ongoing-songs2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 206}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/arts/28ongoing-songs2/28ongoing-songs2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 352, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/arts/28ongoing-songs2/28ongoing-songs2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 703, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/arts/28ongoing-songs2/28ongoing-songs2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', '