ticle/5a42a4c9-08af-5284-a679-87483f2c05ec'}, {'abstract': 'Aides to the New York governor, Andrew M. Cuomo, repeatedly prevented state health officials from releasing the number of nursing home deaths in the pandemic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/28/nyregion/cuomo-aides-nursing-home-deaths.html', 'snippet': 'Aides to the New York governor, Andrew M. Cuomo, repeatedly prevented state health officials from releasing the number of nursing home deaths in the pandemic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The effort by Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s office to obscure the pandemic death toll in New York nursing homes was far greater than previously known, with aides repeatedly overruling state health officials over a span of at least five months, according to interviews and newly unearthed documents.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/nyregion/28cuomo-nursinghomes/merlin_186636936_3a5b6de6-c117-4e53-baec-577d0b1c8b21-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/28/nyregion/28cuomo-nursinghomes/merlin_186636936_3a5b6de6-c117-4e53-baec-577d0b1c8b21-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/nyregion/28cuomo-nursinghomes/merlin_186636936_3a5b6de6-c117-4e53-baec-577d0b1c8b21-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/28/nyregion/28cuomo-nursinghomes/merlin_186636936_3a5b6de6-c117-4e53-baec-577d0b1c8b21-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbn