l 30, 2021.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/29/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day-hauling-loads-with-pets-at-their-side.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Friday, April 30, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': '“You’re alone with yourself for long periods, and having a companion helps. A little happiness boost gets you through.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: Hauling Loads, With Pets at Their Side', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-04-30T01:19:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/9f795565-31b3-5b9b-9def-23bf1cf61a54', 'word_count': 40, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f795565-31b3-5b9b-9def-23bf1cf61a54'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Friday, April 30, 2021.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/29/pageoneplus/corrections-april-30-2021.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Friday, April 30, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An obituary on Sunday about Allon Schoener, the curator who organized the Metropolitan Museum of Art’s 1969 show “Harlem on My Mind,” referred imprecisely to the paintings damaged as part of a protest against that show. Although initial news reports said that one of them was a Rembrandt, subsequent scholarship suggests that it was not. And a picture caption with the obituary misstated the given name of one of the people shown with Mr. Schoener. She is A’Lelia Nelson, not Lelia.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: April 30, 2021', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-04-30T01:19:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/cb272c37-4655-575e-9b39-4445dcabaf94', 'word_count': 200, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cb272c37-4655-575e-9b39-4445dcabaf94'}, {'abstract': 'President Moon Jae-in of South Korea has urged President Biden to kick-start negotiations with North Korea, calling denuclearization a “matter of survival” for South Korea.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/29/us/politics/south-korea-biden-president-moon.html', 'snippet': 'President Moon Jae-in of South Korea has urged President Biden to kick-start negotiations with North Korea, calling denuclearization a “matter of survival” for South Korea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Biden will meet with President Moon Jae-in of South Korea in Washington on May 21, the White House announced on Thursday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/29/us/29new-washington-briefing-south-korea-1/merlin_186602187_0fc34f00-37c4-4263-a0ed-fd90a01ab2e1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/29/us/29new-washington-briefing-south-korea-1/merlin_186602187_0fc34f00-37c4-4263-a0ed-fd90a01ab2e1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/29/us/29new-washington-briefing-south-korea-1/merlin_186602187_0fc34f00-37c4-4263-a0ed-fd90a01ab2e1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/29/u