bstract': 'But the F.B.I. is still using residual authority to obtain business records under a partly expired Patriot Act provision, a new report showed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/30/us/politics/national-security-surveillance-pandemic.html', 'snippet': 'But the F.B.I. is still using residual authority to obtain business records under a partly expired Patriot Act provision, a new report showed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The number of people targeted by the F.B.I. for court-approved searches and surveillance in terrorism and espionage investigations dropped sharply in 2020, a report released Friday said, amid the pandemic and the continuing political and legal fallout from the F.B.I.’s botched use of its eavesdropping power in the Trump-Russia investigation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/30/us/politics/30dc-surveillance/merlin_183223026_1c2a4241-873c-48c1-b034-a6b8ac04ec53-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/30/us/politics/30dc-surveillance/merlin_183223026_1c2a4241-873c-48c1-b034-a6b8ac04ec53-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/30/us/politics/30dc-surveillance/merlin_183223026_1c2a4241-873c-48c1-b034-a6b8ac04ec53-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/30/us/politics/30dc-surveillance/merlin_183223026_1c2a4241-873c-48c1-b034-a6b8ac04ec53-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type':